  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Fishforce Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Suppport to the Nelson Mandela Metropolitan Municipality (NMMU) to develop and implement a training program for fisheries law enforcement officers and lay the foundation for a regional fisheries law enforcement academy. The project is implemented in collaboration with the Norwegian Ministry of Trade Industry and Fisheries (NFD). The ultimate goal is to contribute towards combating fish crimes in developing countries.</narrative>
  </description>
